      "content": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "yzqklpy",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5. Types of Nervous System"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "dgy0obd",
      "content": "• Central Nervous System (Brain &amp; Spinal Cord)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "1hoo7it",
      "content": "• Peripheral Nervous System (Cranial &amp; Spinal nerves)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "7vfz70o",
      "content": "• Autonomic Nervous System (Sympathetic &amp; Parasympathetic)."
    },
    {
      "id": "urk8xpm",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "6. Brain – Structure & Functions"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "alnlt1t",
      "content": "• Cerebrum – Intelligence, memory, voluntary actions."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ofrvu6x",
      "content": "• Cerebellum – Balance and posture."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "c7x1s0u",
      "content": "• Medulla Oblongata – Controls breathing, heartbeat."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "xhelsiu",
      "content": "• Forebrain – Thinking region."
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "CHAPTER 6: CONTROL & COORDINATION",
      "id": "itahbgm"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "auyc9di",
      "content": "• Midbrain – Visual &amp; auditory reflexes."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ou9jdyi",
      "content": "• Hindbrain – Balance &amp; involuntary control."
    },
    {
      "id": "b9cp91p",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "7. Spinal Cord"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "av5xwv7",
      "content": "• Protected by vertebral column."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "7g3fbc0",
      "content": "• Conducts impulses to and from brain."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "c2ovmuy",
      "content": "• Controls reflex actions."
    },
    {
      "id": "fiz12u0",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "8. Reflex Action & Reflex Arc"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "8xk2fl1",
      "content": "• Quick automatic response."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "oqlj0e1",
      "content": "• Controlled by spinal cord."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "mafm5gu",
      "content": "• Reflex Arc: Receptor → Sensory neuron → Interneuron → Motor neuron → Effector."
    },
    {
      "id": "ukaj3yw",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "9. Endocrine System – Overview"
    },
