    {
      "id": "tulw22x",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "11. Hormonal Disorders"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "r9sn38l",
      "content": "• Diabetes – Lack of insulin."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "9cfl8q5",
      "content": "• Goitre – Iodine deficiency."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "czxfk58",
      "content": "• Gigantism – Excess growth hormone."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "zt0l60n",
      "content": "• Dwarfism – Deficiency of growth hormone."
    },
    {
      "id": "ugwlo92",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "12. Plant Hormones"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "3wqsdm1",
      "content": "• Auxin – Cell elongation."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "k8kr1go",
      "content": "• Gibberellin – Stem growth."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "1dtlcl5",
      "content": "• Cytokinin – Cell division."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "e9f9v4c",
      "content": "• Ethylene – Fruit ripening."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "qr6vvzz",
      "content": "• Abscisic Acid – Growth inhibition &amp; dormancy."
    },
    {
      "id": "w3mxh61",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "13. Movements in Plants"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Cerebellum controls posture, balance, and precision of voluntary actions.",
        "Medulla Oblongata regulates involuntary activities such as heartbeat, blood pressure, and salivation.",
        "Iodine is essential for thyroxine hormone synthesis; deficiency leads to Goitre.",
        "Abscisic Acid (ABA) acts as a plant growth inhibitor and promotes leaf wilting."
      ],
      "id": "k7uvx6b"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "de6v8hw",
      "content": "• Tropic Movements – Directional (Phototropism, Geotropism)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "25k2pit",
      "content": "• Nastic Movements – Non-directional (Touch-me-not plant)."
    },
    {
      "id": "uauv8qp",
      "type": "heading",
