      "content": "3. Reflex action controlled by spinal cord."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "1gd1mhn",
      "content": "4. Pituitary is master gland."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "c14dvqt",
      "content": "5. Insulin regulates blood sugar."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "2yu3f8y",
      "content": "6. Auxin promotes plant growth."
    }
